          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP671 Oldman River&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;N 49° 43.961 W 113° 23.924&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This was a park on the side of the road out of traffic. Grab cap and watch 6 teenagers walk right down the middle of the road with their dogs. As we turned around they were crossing the bridge and grudgingly moved over to let the car pass within inchs of their animals...ahh.... youth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7th of the day &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This was  a nice view of the river.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
